# Home Assistant owns this directory now that it's bind mounted whole, and it
# writes its runtime state here: the SQLite recorder database, logs, and
# .storage/, which holds auth tokens, the entity registry and every
# integration's config entry. None of that belongs in git. Track only the
# YAML this repo manages, so ignore everything and allow those files back in.
/*
!.gitignore
!automations.yaml
!configuration.yaml
!scenes.yaml
!scripts.yaml
